## Decision 7: See More / Collapse Pattern

**Sections that get this treatment:**

| Section | Initial state | Hidden count | Trigger text |
|---|---|---|---|
| News Highlights | Shows first 4 items | All remaining | "Show all news" |
| Publications | Shows all 2025 items + first 2024 item | Older year groups | "Show older publications" |
| Projects | Shows first 3 project cards | Remaining 2 | "Show all projects" |
| CV Timeline (each group) | Shows first 3 items per group | Remaining | "Show full history" |

**Implementation pattern** (shared across all sections, driven by a single JS function):

**HTML attribute approach — no unique JS per section:**

```html
<!-- Any list or grid container gets: -->
<ol class="news-timeline" data-see-more="4">
  <!-- items... -->
</ol>
<div class="see-more-wrap">
  <button class="see-more-btn" aria-expanded="false">
    Show all news
    <svg class="see-more-icon" ...chevron-down...></svg>
  </button>
</div>
```

The `data-see-more="4"` attribute tells the JS how many items to show initially. The JS reads this attribute at init time, hides items beyond that count, and toggles on button click. No per-section code needed.

**Shared JS function** (replaces any per-section logic):

```javascript
// ---------- See More / Collapse (universal) ----------
(function initSeeMore() {
  document.querySelectorAll('[data-see-more]').forEach(function (container) {
    var max     = parseInt(container.getAttribute('data-see-more'), 10);
    var items   = Array.from(container.children);
    var wrap    = container.nextElementSibling;           // .see-more-wrap
    var btn     = wrap && wrap.querySelector('.see-more-btn');
    var icon    = btn && btn.querySelector('.see-more-icon');
    var hiddenItems = items.slice(max);

    if (!btn || hiddenItems.length === 0) {
      if (wrap) wrap.hidden = true;
      return;
    }

    // Initial state — hide overflow items
    hiddenItems.forEach(function (el) { el.hidden = true; });

    btn.addEventListener('click', function () {
      var isExpanded = btn.getAttribute('aria-expanded') === 'true';

      hiddenItems.forEach(function (el) { el.hidden = isExpanded; });
      btn.setAttribute('aria-expanded', String(!isExpanded));
      btn.firstChild.textContent = isExpanded
        ? btn.getAttribute('data-label-more') || 'Show more'
        : btn.getAttribute('data-label-less') || 'Show less';

      if (icon) {
        icon.style.transform = isExpanded ? 'rotate(0deg)' : 'rotate(180deg)';
      }

      // Smooth scroll to first revealed item when expanding
      if (!isExpanded && hiddenItems[0]) {
        hiddenItems[0].scrollIntoView({ behavior: 'smooth', block: 'nearest' });
      }
    });
  });
})();
```

